00:09:46.485 --> 00:09:48.020
help assemble the radio show

00:09:48.020 --> 00:09:50.323
and give my pitches
for the TV show.

00:09:50.323 --> 00:09:51.557
So I love that stuff.

00:09:51.557 --> 00:09:52.825
